    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Filomena finally leaves her home to enjoy the garden during the springtime. When she discovers a flyer for a gardening contest, she decides to participate while waiting for her beloved granddaughter, Frida.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Filomena on her journey to the contest's end and enjoy a soothing experience as you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tend to the garden</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock tools from an old sketchbook</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive heartfelt letters from loved ones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cherish memories of Frida with each passing day.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Tale in The Garden offers a nostalgic and reflective narrative about aging, set in a beautiful environment, inviting players to immerse themselves in a gently paced, peaceful adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158630/extras/c1cffadee9b9ef7dd4c602f066b80664.avif?t=1747303505\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Filomena finally leaves her home to enjoy the garden during the springtime. When she discovers a flyer for a gardening contest, she decides to participate while waiting for her beloved granddaughter, Frida.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Filomena on her journey to the contest's end and enjoy a soothing experience as you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tend to the garden</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock tools from an old sketchbook</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive heartfelt letters from loved ones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cherish memories of Frida with each passing day.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Tale in The Garden offers a nostalgic and reflective narrative about aging, set in a beautiful environment, inviting players to immerse themselves in a gently paced, peaceful adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158630/extras/c1cffadee9b9ef7dd4c602f066b80664.avif?t=1747303505\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p>",
